    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CREATE YOUR SANCTUARY</h2>Venture into the wilds to find furniture and collectables, catch fish, and collect bugs to bring back to your fully customisable sanctuary.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >5 UNIQUE AREAS</h2>Traverse and glide through 5 unique areas, uncovering secrets and meeting a cast of eclectic characters.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE STORY OF A DYING WORLD</h2>A prequel to the events of Star Farmer: Warlock of the Universe, stave off the death of the planet by creating a sanctuary and healing the environment around you.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Create your unique sanctuary amidst a dying world.<br></li><li> Go fishing and catch bugs to bring back your growing safe haven.<br></li><li> Attract unique fauna to your sanctuary as it grows.<br></li><li> Follow the story of a dying world and your role in its last stand.<br></li><li> Glide through the skies in Tora's Garden's vertical environments.<br></li><li> Help the locals that deal with the challenges a dying world brings.<br></li><li> Find hidden furniture, plants, props and more to decorate your sanctuary.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CREATE YOUR SANCTUARY</h2>Venture into the wilds to find furniture and collectables, catch fish, and collect bugs to bring back to your fully customisable sanctuary.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >5 UNIQUE AREAS</h2>Traverse and glide through 5 unique areas, uncovering secrets and meeting a cast of eclectic characters.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE STORY OF A DYING WORLD</h2>A prequel to the events of Star Farmer: Warlock of the Universe, stave off the death of the planet by creating a sanctuary and healing the environment around you.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Create your unique sanctuary amidst a dying world.<br></li><li> Go fishing and catch bugs to bring back your growing safe haven.<br></li><li> Attract unique fauna to your sanctuary as it grows.<br></li><li> Follow the story of a dying world and your role in its last stand.<br></li><li> Glide through the skies in Tora's Garden's vertical environments.<br></li><li> Help the locals that deal with the challenges a dying world brings.<br></li><li> Find hidden furniture, plants, props and more to decorate your sanctuary.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Catch fish, collect bugs, find furniture and help the locals as you create your sanctuary on a dying world.",
